  "title": "Zucchini Potato Soup",
  "description": "This zucchini potato soup is perfectly seasoned with fresh dill, thyme, rosemary, and basil. Deliciously satisfying served hot or chilled.",
  "authors": [
    "William Uncle Bill Anatooskin"
